{"id":"n20233-1-31","stage":0,"title":"시험 · 考试","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20233-1-31-1","ko":"시험은 잘 봤니?","zh":"考试考得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험은","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f67c1ebde489c2e43fc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20233-1-31-2","ko":"공부를 안 해서 이번 시험은 못 봤어요.","zh":"因为没用功学习，这次考得不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources